- Call back the Earnest Money Deposit (EMD) and submit a separate Bank Guarantee (BG) in lieu of the Initial Security Deposit (ISD)/Security Deposit (SD).  
- The BG must conform to the proforma specified in Annexure 17.  
- Validity of the BG shall be 03 months beyond contract completion or 03 months beyond the end of the defect liability period, whichever is later.  
- The sponsoring function must ensure:  
  • BG strictly follows the prescribed proforma;  
  • Online systems are available for monitoring and handling of BGs;  
  • Prompt renewal of the BG when required;  
  • Immediate realization of the EMD from the BG upon any contractor breach of tender/contract terms.  

(Procurement of Works Manual, p. 64)

